1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Guys, my son died.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,980
I've been gone for the last two weeks
grieving.

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:18,250
I hope none of you ever go through the
loss of a loved one like I have.

4
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,330
Toby was a great kid,

5
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,470
even with all his disadvantages.

6
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:36,140
His tongue was too long. Wow, bro! That
guy's son died!

7
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,320
He wasn't the one who did that!

